{"id":"skyrpg-level-max","title":"SkyRPG Level: the maximum","category":"reference","icon":"minecraft:nether_star","summary":"The highest SkyRPG Level you can reach with everything in the game today: level 230 (23,038 XP). The level has no hard cap, but every XP source is finite.","blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The highest SkyRPG Level a player can reach is "},{"x":"level 230","b":true},{"x":", with 23,038 SkyRPG XP in all. This page is worked out from the game's data files each time the wiki is built, so it follows every change to quests, collections, skills, slayers and bosses."}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"The level has no cap in the game, but every source of XP is finite. With all of it collected, 38 XP is left over towards level 231. More content later means a higher maximum."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"By source","anchor":"by-source"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Source"}],[{"x":"How many"}],[{"x":"XP each"}],[{"x":"XP in all"}],[{"x":"Share"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Quests"}],[{"x":"59"}],[{"x":"varies"}],[{"x":"18,090"}],[{"x":"78.5%"}]],[[{"x":"Collection tiers (63 collections)"}],[{"x":"567"}],[{"x":"4"}],[{"x":"2,268"}],[{"x":"9.8%"}]],[[{"x":"Skill levels (7 skills)"}],[{"x":"350"}],[{"x":"5"}],[{"x":"1,750"}],[{"x":"7.6%"}]],[[{"x":"Slayer levels (4 lines)"}],[{"x":"36"}],[{"x":"10"}],[{"x":"360"}],[{"x":"1.6%"}]],[[{"x":"First kill: dungeon champion"}],[{"x":"8"}],[{"x":"20 to 60"}],[{"x":"300"}],[{"x":"1.3%"}]],[[{"x":"First kill: dungeon boss"}],[{"x":"8"}],[{"x":"15"}],[{"x":"120"}],[{"x":"0.5%"}]],[[{"x":"First kill: region boss"}],[{"x":"6"}],[{"x":"15"}],[{"x":"90"}],[{"x":"0.4%"}]],[[{"x":"First kill: world boss"}],[{"x":"4"}],[{"x":"15"}],[{"x":"60"}],[{"x":"0.3%"}]],[[{"x":"Total","b":true}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":""}],[{"x":"23,038","b":true}],[{"x":"100%"}]]],"align":["l","r","r","r","r"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"23,038 XP at 100 XP a level is level 230, with 38 XP left over."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Skills","anchor":"skills"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Each skill level gives 5 XP